<t>A profile of RFC 6234's SHA-384 and SHA-512 test results for sha384 and
sha512 in nish/crypto/sha512 (std/crypto/sha512.ts). It holds every
byte-length test of Section 8.5 that vector can state, and properties of
the digest's length and of SHA-384's own initial hash value.</t>
    </abstract>
  </front>
